WEBVTT

00:00:04.027 --> 00:00:06.162
Choose the colors you like to write in.

00:00:06.462 --> 00:00:08.853
Light, dark, or follow the system.

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:16.476
Five themes are built in, each in light and dark.

00:00:19.377 --> 00:00:23.752
Import more: Typecase reads the theme files of GNOME Text Editor.

00:00:27.074 --> 00:00:29.614
Or build your own. The guide shows how.

00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:32.350
Write in your colors.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.982
Typecase. Free software, made for GNOME.

00:00:36.282 --> 00:00:38.865
With love, by kleinod.studio.
